    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008030040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "友達にね、デートの事アドバイスしたら\r\n助かったって喜んでもらえたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400803/2014008030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、よかったじゃないか！\r\nどんな話をしてあげたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008030050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっへへ～、それはね～……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400803/2014008030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008030060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "この間甜花ちゃんとお出かけしたんだ～！\r\nその時のことをお話ししたのっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400803/2014008030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実際に出かけたことなら参考にしやすそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014008030070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　友達もそう言ってくれてた！",
